          "id": "prt_msg_ses_43_06_03",
          "sessionID": "ses_43",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_43_06",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You won't lose them — git actually refuses to switch branches if the checkout would overwrite changes that conflict with the target branch, so you'd just get an error. But the clean way to handle this is `git stash`, switch branches, do your check, switch back, then `git stash pop` to restore everything exactly as it was."
        },
        {
          "id": "prt_msg_ses_43_06_04",
          "sessionID": "ses_43",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_43_06",
